## 4.19.0 December 2026

CIAO 4.19 only supports Python 3.13.

New Scripts

Updated Scripts

  convert_xspec_user_model

    Fixes for the --udmget and --udmget64 options.

  dax

    Added the "Toggle Live Contour" task which works with polygon regions.
    When a polygon is moved, edited, or rotated it is replaced by a
    contour created by the dmimglasso tool - and controlled by the
    new lasso_low and lasso_high parameters in the dax parameter file.

    The dax system is now faster to load as the time-intensive imports
    are now only made when needed.

  monitor_photom

    The script has been sped up and several minor issues have been
    addressed: the count_rate column is no-longer clipped to a minumum
    of 10 e-/s as the clipping is now only applied to the mag column;
    warm pixels now need at least min_dark_meas measurements (previously
    it needed more than this limit); and it will now error out if the
    monitor window moves further than max_dither_motion_pixels rather
    than the previous behaviour of using incorrect dark-current values.

  search_csc, obsid_search_csc

    The scripts now default to using version 2.2 of the Chandra Source
    Catalog (the catalog parameter can now be set to "csc2.2" rather than
    relying on using "current" to search CSC 2.2).


New modules


Updated modules

  ciao_contrib.runtool

    Reduced the time needed to import the module and it has been updated
    to match CIAO 4.19.

  coords.chandra

    The RA_PNT, DEC_PNT, and ROLL_PNT keyword values are now included in
    the output of the get_coord_keywords routine.
